                <mxCell id="S12gfAqzzEclAbF5FXtb-128" parent="S12gfAqzzEclAbF5FXtb-126" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="1. We would also need to add the&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 153, 77));&quot;&gt; security to verify sender and encrypt data&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
