                <mxCell id="54" parent="41" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The browser&#39;s push infrastructure: -&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Receives the push event from the&amp;nbsp; push services infra sent via application server&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Wakes only the correct site&#39;s service worker&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="110" width="377" y="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="103" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#d80073;strokeColor=#A50040;fontColor=#ffffff;" value="browser identificaiton" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="260" width="400" x="-370" y="641" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="90" x="-250" y="740" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="107" parent="103" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;When a browser first sets up push capability (usually on first subscription, sometimes at browser install), it registers itself with the vendor&#39;s push service and gets back something like a &lt;strong&gt;connection/channel identity&lt;/strong&gt; — for example:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chrome/Android → a &lt;strong&gt;Firebase Instance ID / FCM registration token&lt;/strong&gt; (managed at the Play Services level)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Firefox → an internal &lt;strong&gt;channel ID&lt;/strong&gt; with Mozilla&#39;s autopush&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Safari/iOS → the &lt;strong&gt;APNs device token&lt;/strong&gt;, OS-level&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="180" width="400" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="106" parent="103" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;strong data-end=&quot;158&quot; data-start=&quot;53&quot;&gt;push subscription itself is registered with the push service and is tied to that browser installation&lt;/strong&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="50" width="400" y="210" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
